            "created_at": "2025-09-03T20:04:18.894073+00:00",
            "notes": "We have made it to the final round, we are able to pick up [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) to squeeze as much value out of [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7), the last key piece to our build is [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0) which will maximize the potential from Rally.\n\nIF you genuinely are the ONLY redeeming factor on your team and believe you need as much power as possible to enable yourself to carry, [Burst Aid](item_a676ca4f-264e-46b1-8a4a-9aa732b95eae) is a great option instead of [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0), as this will act as a get out of jail free card with all the packs you will be generating with [Nullifier Neuroworks](item_6501be99-b951-4dad-9bb5-8305eb17d84e).\n\nSince there is more than enough ridiculous burst dps builds by this point in the game you should be wary about your engagements more than ever. You should shift your aggression to align with the tempo of Rally. As soon as you get Rally you should be looking to use it at the earliest opportunity, and going full speed with it. As you build rally you should try to minimize los from the whole of their team and hitting your cooldowns to generate it as fast as possible.\n\nGood Luck!",
